3. Interferometer Polarimetry\
Interferometer and polarimetry chords are specified in a diagnostic dot file.\
\
Namelist input values:\

\f1 ipch_dot_filename
\f0 	Path to the interferometer polarimetry diagnostic dot file.\
\
Diagnostic Dot File Keywords:\
\
\pard\tx529\pardeftab529\pardirnatural

\f1 \cf0 \CocoaLigature0 end_of_file
\f0 								\
Specifies the end of the diagnostic dot file.\

\f1 \CocoaLigature1 \
ip_chord_XYZ
\f0 , 
\f1 ip_chord_XYZ_int
\f0 				\
Specifies an interferometer chord in xyz coordinates. Must be followed by a chord name then two lines of three real numbers.\

\f1 \
ip_chord_RPhiDegZ
\f0 , 
\f1 ip_chord_RPhiDegZ_int
\f0 	\
Specifies an interferometer chord in cylindrical coordinates. Must be followed by a chord name then two lines of three real numbers. Phi is in degrees.\

\f1 \
ip_chord_XYZ_pol
\f0 							\
Specifies a polarimetry chord in xyz coordinates. Must be followed by a chord name then two lines of three real numbers and third line of beam wavelength in meters. Data is specified as the faraday rotation angle in radians.\

\f1 \
ip_chord_RPhiDegZ_pol					
\f0 	\
Specifies a polarimetry chord in cylindrical coordinates. Must be followed by a chord name then two lines of three real numbers and third line of beam wavelength in meters. Phi is in degrees. Data is specified as the faraday rotation angle in radians.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural
\cf0 \
