\fs28 III. Models
\fs24 \

\b0 Each signal is calculated from a model of that signal. Some signals can be determined directly from VMEC. Other signals need additional models imposed on top of the equilibrium in the form of a flux surface constant profile. Data is specified as total enclosed current in the Z direction.
\b \

\b0 \
A. VMEC\
The VMEC model provides magnetic field information and geometry. Profiles of the plasma pressure and plasma current.\
\
